<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uk">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - Blacksmith Store</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/BlacksmithStoreWeb.styles.css" asp-append-version="true" />

    <style>
        .nav-icon-btn {
            color: var(--bs-orange) !important;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

            .nav-icon-btn:hover {
                color: #fff !important;
                transform: scale(1.1);
                filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 0, 0.6));
            }

        .theme-switch {
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
            width: 64px;
            height: 32px;
            margin: 0;
        }

            .theme-switch input {
                opacity: 0;
                width: 0;
                height: 0;
            }

        .slider {
            position: absolute;
            cursor: pointer;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            border: 1px solid #444;
            transition: .4s;
            border-radius: 34px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 8px;
        }

            .slider:before {
                position: absolute;
                content: "";
                height: 24px;
                width: 24px;
                left: 3px;
                bottom: 3px;
                background-color: #ddd;
                transition: .4s;
                border-radius: 50%;
                z-index: 1;
            }

        input:checked + .slider {
            border-color: var(--bs-orange);
        }

            input:checked + .slider:before {
                transform: translateX(32px);
                background-color: var(--bs-orange);
            }

        .slider svg {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            z-index: 2;
            position: relative;
            transition: fill 0.4s ease;
        }

        input:not(:checked) + .slider .icon-sun {
            fill: #000;
        }

        input:not(:checked) + .slider .icon-moon {
            fill: #666;
        }

        input:checked + .slider .icon-sun {
            fill: #666;
        }

        input:checked + .slider .icon-moon {
            fill: #000;
        }

        .premium-footer {
            background-color: #080808;
            color: #aaa;
            position: relative;
            margin-top: 80px;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        .footer-top-border {
            height: 4px;
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #080808 0%, var(--bs-orange) 50%, #080808 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(253, 126, 20, 0.4);
        }

        .footer-brand {
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
        }

            .footer-brand span {
                color: var(--bs-orange);
            }

        .footer-text {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .footer-title {
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            position: relative;
            padding-bottom: 12px;
        }

            .footer-title::after {
                content: '';
                position: absolute;
                left: 0;
                bottom: 0;
                width: 40px;
                height: 2px;
                background-color: var(--bs-orange);
                border-radius: 2px;
            }

        .footer-links {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
        }

            .footer-links li {
                margin-bottom: 12px;
            }

            .footer-links a {
                color: #aaa;
                text-decoration: none;
                transition: all 0.3s ease;
                font-size: 0.95rem;
                display: inline-block;
            }

                .footer-links a:hover {
                    color: var(--bs-orange);
                    transform: translateX(5px);
                }

        .footer-contact {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
        }

            .footer-contact li {
                margin-bottom: 15px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                font-size: 0.95rem;
            }

        .contact-icon {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-right: 12px;
            color: var(--bs-orange);
        }

        .social-icons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .social-icon {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            background-color: #161616;
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 50%;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid #333;
        }

            .social-icon:hover {
                background-color: var(--bs-orange);
                color: #000;
                border-color: var(--bs-orange);
                transform: translateY(-3px);
                box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(253, 126, 20, 0.3);
            }

        .footer-bottom {
            background-color: #050505;
            border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .bottom-links a {
            color: #888;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

            .bottom-links a:hover {
                color: #fff;
            }

        .separator {
            color: #333;
        }

        .slide-up {
            animation: slideUpFade 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1) forwards;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(30px);
        }

        @@keyframes slideUpFade {
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .ai-chat-widget {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            right: 30px;
            z-index: 9999;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-end;
            transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);
        }

        .ai-chat-toggle {
            background-color: var(--bs-orange);
            color: #000;
            border: none;
            width: 65px;
            height: 65px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(253, 126, 20, 0.5);
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

            .ai-chat-toggle:hover {
                transform: scale(1.1);
                box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(253, 126, 20, 0.7);
            }

        .ai-chat-window {
            width: 380px;
            height: 550px;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transform-origin: bottom right;
            animation: chatPopup 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275) forwards;
        }

        @@keyframes chatPopup {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: scale(0.5);
            }

            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: scale(1);
            }
        }

        .ai-chat-header {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #111 0%, #0a0a0a 100%);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--bs-orange);
        }

        .ai-chat-close {
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: color 0.2s;
            line-height: 1;
        }

            .ai-chat-close:hover {
                color: var(--bs-orange);
            }

        .ai-chat-messages {
            flex-grow: 1;
            padding: 20px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
            background-color: #121212;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

            .ai-chat-messages::-webkit-scrollbar {
                width: 6px;
            }

            .ai-chat-messages::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
                background: #444;
                border-radius: 6px;
            }

        .chat-message {
            max-width: 85%;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            word-wrap: break-word;
        }

            .chat-message.bot {
                background-color: #222;
                color: #fff;
                align-self: flex-start;
                border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
                border: 1px solid #333;
            }

                .chat-message.bot strong {
                    color: var(--bs-orange);
                    font-weight: 700;
                }

                .chat-message.bot ul {
                    padding-left: 20px;
                    margin-bottom: 0;
                }

            .chat-message.user {
                background-color: var(--bs-orange);
                color: #000;
                font-weight: 600;
                align-self: flex-end;
                border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
            }

        .ai-chat-input-area {
            display: flex;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            border-top: 1px solid #333;
            gap: 10px;
        }

            .ai-chat-input-area input {
                flex-grow: 1;
                background-color: #111;
                border: 1px solid #444;
                color: #fff;
                padding: 10px 15px;
                border-radius: 20px;
                outline: none;
                transition: border-color 0.3s;
            }

                .ai-chat-input-area input:focus {
                    border-color: var(--bs-orange);
                }

            .ai-chat-input-area button {
                background-color: var(--bs-orange);
                color: #000;
                border: none;
                width: 45px;
                height: 45px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                display: flex;
                justify-content: center;
                align-items: center;
                cursor: pointer;
                transition: background-color 0.3s;
            }

                .ai-chat-input-area button:hover {
                    background-color: #e07b00;
                }

        .chat-loading {
            color: #888;
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            align-self: flex-start;
            margin-left: 5px;
        }

        a.navbar-brand {
            white-space: nowrap !important;
            word-break: normal !important;
        }

        .navbar-nav .nav-link.text-light {
            transition: color 0.3s ease, text-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

            .navbar-nav .nav-link.text-light:hover, .navbar-nav .nav-link.text-light:focus {
                color: var(--bs-orange) !important;
                text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(253, 126, 20, 0.4);
            }

        .dropdown-menu-dark {
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            border: 1px solid #444;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        }

            .dropdown-menu-dark .dropdown-item {
                color: #ddd;
                transition: background-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
                font-weight: bold;
                padding: 10px 20px;
            }

                .dropdown-menu-dark .dropdown-item:hover {
                    background-color: var(--bs-orange);
                    color: #000 !important;
                }

        #searchResultsDropdown {
            max-height: 260px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

            #searchResultsDropdown::-webkit-scrollbar {
                width: 6px;
            }

            #searchResultsDropdown::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
                background-color: var(--bs-orange);
                border-radius: 10px;
            }

            #searchResultsDropdown .dropdown-item {
                transition: background-color 0.2s;
            }

                #searchResultsDropdown .dropdown-item:hover {
                    background-color: #333 !important;
                }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-xl navbar-dark border-bottom box-shadow mb-3" style="background-color: var(--bs-black);">
            <div class="container-fluid px-4">
                <a class="navbar-brand me-4" asp-area="" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index" style="font-weight: 900; color: var(--bs-orange); letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 1.5rem;">
                    BLACKSMITH STORE
                </a>
                <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target=".navbar-collapse" aria-controls="navbarSupportedContent" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
                    <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
                </button>
                <div class="navbar-collapse collapse d-xl-inline-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">

                    <form id="searchForm" class="d-flex me-auto my-2 my-xl-0 position-relative" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Catalog" method="get" style="width: 100%; max-width: 350px;">
                        <input id="searchInput" class="form-control me-2" type="search" name="search" placeholder="Пошук товарів..." aria-label="Search" style="background-color: #1a1a1a; color: var(--text-light); border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 5px;" autocomplete="off">
                        <button class="btn px-4" type="submit" style="background-color: var(--bs-orange); color: #000; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 5px;">Знайти</button>

                        <div id="searchResultsDropdown" class="dropdown-menu-dark position-absolute w-100 d-none" style="top: 100%; left: 0; margin-top: 5px; border-radius: 8px; z-index: 1050; border: 1px solid #444; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);">
                        </div>
                    </form>

                    <ul class="navbar-nav d-flex align-items-center gap-3">

                        <li class="nav-item dropdown">
                            <a class="nav-link dropdown-toggle text-light fw-bold" href="#" id="catalogDropdown" role="button" data-bs-toggle="dropdown" aria-expanded="false">
                                Каталог
                            </a>
                            <ul class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-dark" aria-labelledby="catalogDropdown">
                                <li><a class="dropdown-item" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Catalog">Усі товари</a></li>
                                <li><hr class="dropdown-divider" style="border-color: #333;"></li>
                                <li><a class="dropdown-item" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Catalog" asp-route-productType="Взуття">Взуття</a></li>
                                <li><a class="dropdown-item" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Catalog" asp-route-productType="Аксесуар">Аксесуари</a></li>
                            </ul>
                        </li>

                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link text-light fw-bold" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="NewArrivals">Новинки</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link text-light fw-bold" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Favorites">Вподобання</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link text-light fw-bold" asp-controller="Restock" asp-action="Index">Під замовлення</a>
                        </li>

                        <li class="nav-item ms-xl-2 d-flex align-items-center position-relative">
                            <a class="nav-link nav-icon-btn" href="#" onclick="openCart(); return false;" title="Кошик" style="position: relative;">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="26" height="26" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-cart3" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                                    <path d="M0 1.5A.5.5 0 0 1 .5 1H2a.5.5 0 0 1 .485.379L2.89 3H14.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .49.598l-1 5a.5.5 0 0 1-.465.401l-9.397.472L4.415 11H13a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1H4a.5.5 0 0 1-.491-.408L2.01 3.607 1.61 2H.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5zM3.102 4l.84 4.479 9.144-.459L13.89 4H3.102zM5 12a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm7 0a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm-7 1a1 1 0 1 1 0 2 1 1 0 0 1 0-2zm7 0a1 1 0 1 1 0 2 1 1 0 0 1 0-2z" />
                                </svg>
                                <span id="cart-count-badge" class="position-absolute top-0 start-100 translate-middle badge rounded-pill bg-danger d-none" style="font-size: 0.65rem; margin-top: 5px; margin-left: -12px;">
                                    0
                                </span>
                            </a>
                        </li>

                        @if (User.Identity != null && User.Identity.IsAuthenticated)
                        {
                            <li class="nav-item ms-xl-2 d-flex align-items-center">
                                <a class="nav-link nav-icon-btn" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Profile" title="Профіль: @User.Identity.Name">
                                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-person-circle" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M11 6a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0z" /><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8zm8-7a7 7 0 0 0-5.468 11.37C3.242 11.226 4.805 10 8 10s4.757 1.225 5.468 2.37A7 7 0 0 0 8 1z" /></svg>
                                </a>
                            </li>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <li class="nav-item ms-xl-2 d-flex align-items-center">
                                <a class="nav-link text-light fw-bold" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Login">Увійти</a>
                            </li>
                        }
                        <li class="nav-item ms-xl-3 d-flex align-items-center">
                            <label class="theme-switch" title="Перемкнути тему">
                                <input type="checkbox" id="themeCheckbox" onchange="toggleTheme()">
                                <span class="slider">
                                    <svg class="icon-sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 7c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5s2.24 5 5 5 5-2.24 5-5-2.24-5-5-5zM2 13h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1s-.45-1-1-1H2c-.55 0-1 .45-1 1s.45 1 1 1zm18 0h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1s-.45-1-1-1h-2c-.55 0-1 .45-1 1s.45 1 1 1zM11 2v2c0 .55.45 1 1 1s1-.45 1-1V2c0-.55-.45-1-1-1s-1 .45-1 1zm0 18v2c0 .55.45 1 1 1s1-.45 1-1v-2c0-.55-.45-1-1-1s-1 .45-1 1zM5.99 4.58c-.39-.39-1.03-.39-1.41 0-.39.39-.39 1.03 0 1.41l1.06 1.06c.39.39 1.03.39 1.41 0 .39-.39.39-1.03 0-1.41L5.99 4.58zm12.37 12.37c-.39-.39-1.03-.39-1.41 0-.39.39-.39 1.03 0 1.41l1.06 1.06c.39.39 1.03.39 1.41 0 .39-.39.39-1.03 0-1.41l-1.06-1.06zm1.06-10.96c.39-.39.39-1.03 0-1.41-.39-.39-1.03-.39-1.41 0l-1.06 1.06c-.39.39-.39 1.03 0 1.41.39.39 1.03.39 1.41 0l1.06-1.06zM7.05 18.36c.39-.39.39-1.03 0-1.41-.39-.39-1.03-.39-1.41 0l-1.06 1.06c-.39.39-.39 1.03 0 1.41.39.39 1.03.39 1.41 0l1.06-1.06z" /></svg>
                                    <svg class="icon-moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3c-4.97 0-9 4.03-9 9s4.03 9 9 9 9-4.03 9-9c0-.46-.04-.92-.1-1.36-.98 1.37-2.58 2.26-4.4 2.26-3.03 0-5.5-2.47-5.5-5.5 0-1.82.89-3.42 2.26-4.4-.44-.06-.9-.1-1.36-.1z" /></svg>
                                </span>
                            </label>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="container-fluid p-0">
        <main role="main" class="pb-3">
            @RenderBody()
        </main>
    </div>

    <div id="ai-chat-widget" class="ai-chat-widget">
        <div id="ai-chat-window" class="ai-chat-window d-none">
            <div class="ai-chat-header">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center">
                    <div style="background-color: var(--bs-orange); border-radius: 50%; width: 36px; height: 36px; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-right: 12px;">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="#000" class="bi bi-robot" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M6 12.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5ZM3 8.062C3 6.76 4.235 5.765 5.53 5.889a28.02 28.02 0 0 1 4.94 0C11.765 5.765 13 6.76 13 8.062v1.157a.933.933 0 0 1-.765.935c-.845.147-2.34.346-4.235.346-1.895 0-3.39-.2-4.235-.346A.933.933 0 0 1 3 9.219V8.062Zm4.542-.827a.25.25 0 0 0-.217.068l-.92.9a24.767 24.767 0 0 1-1.871-.183.25.25 0 0 0-.068.495c.55.076 1.232.149 2.02.193a.25.25 0 0 0 .189-.071l.754-.736.847 1.71a.25.25 0 0 0 .404.062l.932-.97a25.286 25.286 0 0 0 1.922-.188.25.25 0 0 0-.068-.495c-.538.074-1.207.145-1.98.189a.25.25 0 0 0-.166.076l-.754.785-.842-1.7a.25.25 0 0 0-.182-.135Z" /><path d="M8.5 1.866a1 1 0 1 0-1 0V3h-2A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 1 7.5V8a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V9a1 1 0 0 0-1-1v-.5A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 10.5 3h-2V1.866ZM14 7.5V13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H3a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 5.5 4h5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 14 7.5Z" /></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <strong class="d-block" style="font-size: 1.05rem;">Blacksmith Асистент</strong>
                        <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #888; font-weight: bold;">● Завжди онлайн</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button class="ai-chat-close" onclick="toggleAiChat()">✖</button>
            </div>
            <div id="ai-chat-messages" class="ai-chat-messages">
                <div class="chat-message bot">
                    Привіт! Я віртуальний асистент Blacksmith Store. Допомогти вам з вибором товарів чи підказати розмір?
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-chat-input-area">
                <input type="text" id="ai-chat-input" placeholder="Запитайте щось..." onkeypress="handleChatEnter(event)" />
                <button id="ai-chat-send" onclick="sendAiMessage()">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-send-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M15.964.686a.5.5 0 0 0-.65-.65L.767 5.855H.766l-.452.18a.5.5 0 0 0-.082.887l.41.26.001.002 4.995 3.178 3.178 4.995.002.002.26.41a.5.5 0 0 0 .886-.083l6-15Zm-1.833 1.89L6.637 10.07l-.215-.338a.5.5 0 0 0-.154-.154l-.338-.215 7.494-7.494 1.178-.471-.47 1.178Z" /></svg>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <button id="ai-chat-toggle" class="ai-chat-toggle" onclick="toggleAiChat()">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="30" height="30" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-chat-dots-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M16 8c0 3.866-3.582 7-8 7a9.06 9.06 0 0 1-2.347-.306c-.584.296-1.925.864-4.181 1.234-.2.032-.352-.176-.273-.362.354-.836.674-1.95.77-2.966C.744 11.37 0 9.76 0 8c0-3.866 3.582-7 8-7s8 3.134 8 7zM5 8a1 1 0 1 0-2 0 1 1 0 0 0 2 0zm4 0a1 1 0 1 0-2 0 1 1 0 0 0 2 0zm3 1a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2z" /></svg>
        </button>
    </div>

    <div class="offcanvas offcanvas-end" tabindex="-1" id="cartOffcanvas" aria-labelledby="cartOffcanvasLabel" style="background-color: var(--bs-black); color: var(--text-light); width: 400px; border-left: 2px solid var(--bs-orange);">
